Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:05.79,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Everyone has a side they \Ndon't show anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:10.47,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,To their friends, their significant others,\N or even their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:13.83,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,They hide what they're truly feeling \Nthrough fake smiles or bravado,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.60,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and keep their true identities secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:21.12,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,That is how the world keeps up \Nthe appearance of its temporary peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.53,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In an era in which the nations of \Nthe world were waging a fierce war
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.92,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of information just out of sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:29.42,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,two countries were at odds with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.42,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Ostania, in the east, was secretly \Nplotting to start a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:35.19,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Westalis, in the west, wanted to\N put a stop to those plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In order to keep an eye on the actions of a \Nleading figure in Ostania's government,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.81,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Westalis set Operation Strix in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:44.92,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The one tasked with this operation \Nis the skilled agent, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:48.25,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mission given to the master of \Ndisguise with a hundred faces was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:50.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to start a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:55.98,sign_3297_17_Capital_City_Ber,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(490,275)\fs15\fad(486,1)}128 Park Avenue, West District\NCapital City of Berlint, Ostania
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is this everything you own?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:10.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, Loid... about the \Nsleeping arrangements...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:25.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll be sleeping in \Nseparate rooms, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:28.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll share one for appearances \Nanytime we have guests over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:29.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Welcome to Anya's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lovely welcome, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:39.20,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This house is home to \Na rather unusual family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:42.44,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The father, Loid Forger, is a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.30,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,His true identity: a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.37,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(135,165)\fsp6\fad(1,270)\blur2}Code Name\N{\fs30\fsp0}<Twilight>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.24,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:50.35,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mother, Yor Forger, is a civil \Nservant who works at city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:52.40,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.88,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp6\fad(1,270)\blur2\pos(498,135)}Code Name\N{\fs30\fsp0}<Thorn Princess>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:54.78,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.09,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The daughter, Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:58.76,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: a telepath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to have a mama now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:02.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, right. By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:10.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I had a friend of mine who's a judge \Nmake it so we got married a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:12.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,By that, I mean he forged the certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:19.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We can figure out why we lived separately \Nand what to tell your brother later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:25.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It would make the school suspicious if we \Ngot married just before the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.38,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I got permission from the Shopkeeper,\N so I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:31.54,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So exciting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Father, mother, daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:37.36,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,These three created this pretend \Nfamily to further their own ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:42.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and are living under the same roof as they \Nhide their true identities from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:43.42,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(290,165)\fscx51}PREPARE FOR THE INTERVIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm going to show Mama around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Once we get settled in, \Nwe'll practice the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is good at cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:54.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is the toilet. And that's the bathtub!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:02.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Everything's so clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:08.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I can wash my face all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:10.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You're such a big girl, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:15.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is Anya's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:17.81,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:20.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:23.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My, what an adorable room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:25.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you to Mr. Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:31.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I am Chimera. It is a pweasure \Nto meet your acquiantenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you, Mr. Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:36.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I am Miss Anya's mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is Papa's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So this is Loid's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is your room, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Come in, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:54.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So this is my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What a lovely room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:09.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This should be everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:14.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is the furniture arranged to \Nyour liking? I also cleaned a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, everything is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:18.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I helped clean, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:21.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Really? Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:24.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Am I a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:31.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All you did was tip over a bucket of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:32.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:38.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This is such a lovely room. I don't \Nknow what to do with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:40.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:41.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Please make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:44.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Actually, this {\i1}is{\i0} your home now, \Nso make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:46.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll come get your boxes once they're empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid, I've got everything put away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:58.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're quite efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:03.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, this must be your younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.22,0:07:07.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You said he's also a civil servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:13.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. He seems quite busy lately, \Nso I've only spoken to him on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It seems you two are quite similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:18.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I should properly introduce myself \Nonce Anya's entrance exam is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:22.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, Loid. About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:25.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't have anything suitable\N to wear to this interview...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:29.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Then let's go to the tailor today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Helping, helping...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,M-Miss Anya, I'll take care of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:42.17,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I have my work weapons and poison \Npowerful enough to kill an elephant in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Can I get you something, Loid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Some coffee, please. Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:52.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want hot cocoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,With sugar and milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's the stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:01.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,They look amazing. Are those cookies homemade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's actually my first time making cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:07.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I just followed a recipe from a cookbook,\N so they should be decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I hope you like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:11.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:17.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,They're wonderful! You really\N are an amazing cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:18.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not that impressive, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.43,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I helped with the cookies, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:21.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,After you got covered in \Nflour and got in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:32.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,you just snacked on some peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Once we're settled in, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:43.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Eden College is one of the most \Nprestigious schools in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,During the interview, not only \Nwill the child be evaluated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,but so will the parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:49.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,They will be evaluated on their social \Nstanding as well as how cultured they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:52.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now, let's start the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,First, please state your name and address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:59.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya Fo...Fo...Horger. Address?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:01.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The place we're at right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is Anya's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:03.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:07.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, so, Miss Anya... How do \Nyou spend your days off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:10.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa orders me to stay home,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,so I have to watch TV all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:16.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That makes a terrible impression. Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:17.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:20.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why did you choose Eden College, \Nand how do you plan to pass this exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,How do people usually pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:24.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, pass, passing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:28.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Perhaps because of cardiac arrest, \Nor excessive bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:30.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Or compound fractures throughout the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:33.20,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh! Maybe their skull was caved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:34.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Kill me now. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Could you describe your parenting methods?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:39.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? U-Um... Strike first to be victorious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm amazed her brother turned \Nout to be a decent human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:45.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've been a spy for over a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.95,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've completed countless missions,\Nyet only now do I find myself losing heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.31,0:09:53.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is pointless. There's no way we'll \Nsurvive the interview at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's give up on getting \Nher into that school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:59.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid! Please remember \Nyour late wife's wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:02.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Clearly, we weren't ready \Nfor this mock interview yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, let's go out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:09.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's broaden our horizons, become versed\N in what is normal for an upper-class family,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:12.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and make sure that we're \Nall on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:16.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We're on an ooting, \Nan ooting, la, la, la, lah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:18.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You mean "outing."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:20.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wanna hold hands, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:26.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank goodness Anya's taken a liking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The plan is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,After today, we'll seem like a normal... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:33.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll be seen as an upper-crust family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:38.32,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh... This reminds me of when my little \Nbrother was still small and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:44.99,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,And that one time I hugged him too hard \Nand ended up breaking two of his ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait... what? Maybe not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,B-By the way, where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:11:00.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I've acquired a variety of tickets \Nthrough my connections at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Tradition and status are \Neverything at Eden College.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:21.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll have to experience and get accustomed \Nto the best that life has to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and make sure we don't slip \Nup if we let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:37.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, no yelling while we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:37.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We've experienced first-class music,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,so now for some first-class art...\N And you know the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:46.17,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! I can see her boobies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:49.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Head's been choppy-chopped! \NBody's been choppy-chopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:51.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What did I just say about yelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:11:59.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-Yor...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Drawing? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:12.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor, why don't we sit down for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:16.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's house is a big castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:20.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The boss of the secret organization \Nis Director Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.42,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is a spy! Pew, pew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:25.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is an assassin! \NStabby, stabby, sploosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We should probably get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:30.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:35.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, we're going to our next stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:40.25,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If Papa and Mama see this,\Nthey'll find out about my powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wow, that's quite a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There seems to be a pig in a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Chimera, and he lives in a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:51.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. I definitely see \NBondman there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:52.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:53.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:55.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's that spy cartoon you \Nwere watching last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:59.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So this witch-looking one \Nmust be the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:00.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That part seems rather graphic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:02.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, but that cat is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:02.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's a doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. Then I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We're going to the tailor next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:13.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Sorry to have you do this on your day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's quite all right. This is\N something we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:17.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My going-out clothes are so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:19.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They fit perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:21.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This shop is great! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:23.12,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:26.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is my first ooting \Nin my going-out clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.37,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Then it must be a day of celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:29.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A day to celebrate this ooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,In that case, we can stop by \Na photography studio next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:34.86,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Yor, dear. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:35.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:41.82,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a semi-formal dress, \NI think this color would do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:42.93,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:46.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'd honestly prefer a black or red dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.21,0:13:49.76,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Really? I think this would \Nlook nice on you, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.19,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:55.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Judging from her lack of luggage, \NI thought she had no interest in clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:58.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see you're particular \Nabout matching colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No... I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:06.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,This color's lovely, but I'm worried that \Nblood splatters would be too noticeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:13.89,main,Female employee,0,0,0,,Looks like Yor finally found someone nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:19.13,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Hopefully they last. Having a child \Nalready is an instant no for me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:22.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Looks like the extra outfits will \Nbe ready by the interview, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to have you get so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:28.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, you look nice in \Ncolors besides red and black.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll be going out more often, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ootings! Ootings!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:33.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're a regular at that shop, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:40.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll continue to shop there, so next\N time, we should tell them we're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:15:01.06,top,Politician,0,0,0,,We, the Nationalist Party, believe that \Nthere is a road to peace with the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:03.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Patriotism is also important within Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:01.99,italicstop,Audience A,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:05.37,italicstop,Audience B,0,0,0,,Kill all the bastards in the West!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:05.96,top,Politician,0,0,0,,Continuing to treat Westalis as \Nthe enemy will do us no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll need to make sure she's knowledgeable \Nof politics and history, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.49,italics,Audience C,0,0,0,,Piss off, traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:12.28,italicstop,Audience F,0,0,0,,Gimme money, gimme money, gimme money...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:11.12,italics,Audience D,0,0,0,,Those bastards killed my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:13.61,italicstop,Audience E,0,0,0,,Get lost with the pleasantries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:15.73,italicstop,Audience G,0,0,0,,First I lost my job, then my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.61,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't like places like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:19.06,italicstop,Audience H,0,0,0,,Kill all the shitheads in the West!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:17.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry. Maybe this was a \Nlittle scary for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go rest somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.81,italicstop,Audience I,0,0,0,,The East did nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.91,italicstop,Audience mob,0,0,0,,Go back to your Western masters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:22.91,italics,Audience mob,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:24.01,italics,Audience mob,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:25.12,italicstop,Audience mob,0,0,0,,You stupid baldy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:25.11,italics,Audience mob,0,0,0,,Your feet smell, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:29.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you all right or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:41.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, Anya. Don't just pick the nuts off \Nthe top, and no eating with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:45.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And Yor, uh... Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:47.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've been a spy for over a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:52.72,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've completed countless missions,\Nyet once again I find myself losing heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:54.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,S'all good, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:55.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely picked the wrong child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:03.90,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, this is all because I was \Nexpected to rely on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:09.48,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have put the key to success in \Nthe hands of others, let alone civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:11.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Predicting every possible \Nsituation, preparing for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:13.48,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and acting from a carefully laid-out plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.35,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Those are the ironclad rules of being a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:19.92,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Which means that I need to list every \Npossible question the interviewer can ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:22.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,then have these two memorize the \Nperfect answers to go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If all else fails, make sure \NI can back them up—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:25.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:29.87,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why don't we go get some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:42.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The people look like bits \Nof trash from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:44.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Where did you get that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:49.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I had no idea there was a park like \Nthis on the outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't come here that often either,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:55.30,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but I wander over here when \NI'm exhausted from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:17:01.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thinking about how the work I do \Nhelps everyone in this city out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:03.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,encourages me to work harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:08.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, this place must be awfully \Nboring! I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I like this place better \Nthan crowded places!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:25.90,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Thief! Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.76,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That old lady should've been more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:34.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.95,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I lost track of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:42.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, ma'am? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:45.14,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Just a few scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:49.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I promise I'll catch him for you! \NAnd I'll take you to the hospital later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.24,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:53.72,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I left Loid and Anya behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.72,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He blended in with the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:04.72,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, Yor, but you probably \Nwon't be able to find him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.74,italics,Mob A,0,0,0,,Man, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.35,italics,Mob B,0,0,0,,So expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.42,italicstop,Mob C,0,0,0,,Aw, this is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.11,italics,Mob D,0,0,0,,Crap, I'm gonna piss my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.73,italics,Mob E,0,0,0,,My feet hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:12.73,italicstop,Mob G,0,0,0,,That shopworker is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:15.15,italics,Mob F,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a million \Ndalc lying around somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.43,italicstop,Mob M,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot to pay my rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:15.17,italicstop,Mob H,0,0,0,,Man, he's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.29,italicstop,Mob I,0,0,0,,Honestly, this child...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:18.25,italics,Mob J,0,0,0,,What am I going to do? I failed my test again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:17.17,italics,Mob K,0,0,0,,That bastard. I'm gonna murder him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.64,italicstop,Mob L,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll say hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:21.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:26.74,italics,Thief,0,0,0,,Man, that old crone was loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:29.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:32.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna eat cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:33.76,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We just left the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.35,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:44.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He changed his clothes, but it's not \Nso easy to change the way you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't think you'll get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:51.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor, look after Anya for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:54.64,italics,Thief,0,0,0,,I'll be able to have plenty of \Nfun for a while with this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.23,italics,Thief,0,0,0,,First, I'm gonna treat myself \Nto the finest meal and—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:04.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A filthy swine like you deserves \Nnothing more than the foulest meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.69,main,Mob N,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.59,top,Mob O,0,0,0,,A guy just dropped from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:11.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,A spy must not bring attention to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.14,top,Mob P,0,0,0,,Did he fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:19.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Pardon me. This fellow is a purse snatcher, \Nso please call the police and hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:21.88,main,Mob P,0,0,0,,A purse snatcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:26.08,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Thank you for escorting \Nme all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.98,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,I had money to get my grandchild \Na gift in my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.92,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Thank you so much. You were a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:32.98,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:37.89,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The one who got it back \Nwas my, um, husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:42.26,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, if you weren't there, Yor, \NI wouldn't have even gone after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:45.97,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Thank you so much. What a \Nfine gentleman you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:47.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.43,flashback italics,Chief,0,0,0,,Hero who casts no shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:53.04,flashback italics,Chief,0,0,0,,the great deeds you and your fellow \Nagents do shall never see the light of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.27,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:00.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess... receiving thanks every \Nonce in a while wouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:01.60,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is a softie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Today was a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:11.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now I'll be able to work hard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:19.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa and Mama are flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.12,main,Loid and Yor,0,0,0,,We are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:23.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Does Anya get a thank you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:28.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well... I guess we did find the thief \Nbecause you were hungry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:34.92,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,My, what a lovely family you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:38.62,main,Old woman,0,0,0,,Here's some candy for you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Make sure you say, "Thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.66,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The ooting is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:49.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want some hot cocoa, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:59.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:09.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, more importantly, we need \Nto retry this mock interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:12.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So, Miss Anya, how do you \Nspend your days off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.36,0:21:16.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We go to the opera, the museum, \Nand eat at restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:18.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you're asked this question, \Nmake sure you talk about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:26.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You've seen your friend \Ndo something naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:27.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:35.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'd jump on top of them, beat them up, \Nand make them eat the foulest meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hmm... Pretend you never saw that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:41.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yup, this is hopeless. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:44.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you were so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:48.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ka-bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:51.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's the foulest meal for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hot cocoa is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:10.85,flashback italics,Old woman,0,0,0,,My, what a lovely family you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:16.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess if she saw us that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:20.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,About one percent of my \Npreparations are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.96,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,290)\fscx40}THE PRESTIGIOUS SCHOOL'S INTERVIEW
